  "description": "<p data-end=\"316\" data-start=\"63\"><span style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong data-end=\"88\" data-start=\"63\">&bull; Brand introduction:</strong></span><br data-end=\"91\" data-start=\"88\"><span style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Kaya KoCo is a global Korean skincare and beauty store, shipping to 77 countries. We specialize in curating only the best Korean skincare products, personally tested and loved by our team, ensuring quality and authenticity.</span></p>\r\n<p data-end=\"538\" data-start=\"318\"><span style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong data-end=\"344\" data-start=\"318\">&bull; Product description:</strong></span><br data-end=\"347\" data-start=\"344\"><span style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Our collection includes premium Korean skincare essentials and lip makeup products. We also offer exclusive curated bundles tailored to specific skincare needs.</span></p>\r\n<p data-end=\"575\" data-start=\"540\"><span style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong data-end=\"573\" data-start=\"540\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"761\" data-start=\"576\">\r\n<li data-end=\"615\" data-start=\"576\" style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Exclusive curated skincare bundles</span></li>\r\n<li data-end=\"654\" data-start=\"616\" style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Simple, seamless checkout process</span></li>\r\n<li data-end=\"703\" data-start=\"655\" style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Fast international shipping to 77 countries</span></li>\r\n<li data-end=\"761\" data-start=\"704\" style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\">High-quality products tested and trusted by our team</span></li>\r\n<li data-end=\"761\" data-start=\"704\" style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Aesthetic store user interface</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-end=\"963\" data-start=\"763\"><span style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong data-end=\"783\" data-start=\"763\">&bull; Payment terms:</strong></span><br data-end=\"786\" data-start=\"783\"><span style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Affiliates earn a competitive commission on every successful sale they drive. Payments are processed monthly, with clear and transparent tracking through our affiliate portal.</span></p>\r\n<p data-end=\"991\" data-start=\"965\"><span style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong data-end=\"989\" data-start=\"965\">&bull; Other information:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1270\" data-start=\"992\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1068\" data-start=\"992\" style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Open to influencers, bloggers, beauty experts, and skincare enthusiasts.</span></li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1166\" data-start=\"1069\" style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\">No minimum follower count for joining, but high engagement and quality content are preferred.</span></li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1270\" data-start=\"1167\" style=\"font-family: 'book antiq